{"3401960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "JOIN US", "steam_appid": 3401960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/f457566f014493a6fc90e1c6444a7656.avif?t=1781142103\" width=1280 height=273 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HAVE YOU EVER DREAMED OF STARTING YOUR OWN CULT?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you can - right from the comfort of your own home! Imagine the respect you’ll receive as an up-and-coming cult leader! Issue weird teachings to your followers! Expand your territory! Build a base of operations! Perform sacrifices! Oversee a growing stockpile of military-grade weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this sandbox survival game, your most valuable resource isn’t stones and wood… it’s human beings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/c0215e7c34b2f607a93d5a27976a2682.poster.avif?t=1781142103\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/c0215e7c34b2f607a93d5a27976a2682.webm?t=1781142103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character in the world, from civilians to enemies, is a potential recruit for your growing cult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the game world into your personal follower-farm by spreading propaganda, managing infamy, and making your cult worthy of joining. Once a new follower joins your flock, you can put them to work, play as them, or enlist their support on missions. All of your followers have strengths and weaknesses, and are best used in accordance with their abilities – farmers, smooth-talkers, doctors, etc. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Followers are your most important resource, but also your most volatile. If you don’t keep them happy, they’ll quit the cult. And remember… a cult leader without any followers is just a lonely weirdo.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/5c549a5d54b1883f45fbd976188d93e1.poster.avif?t=1781142103\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/5c549a5d54b1883f45fbd976188d93e1.webm?t=1781142103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It wouldn’t be a cult unless your friends could join. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JOIN US supports up to 4-player co-op. Work together to build the cult of your dreams and crush all those that try to oppose you. The end of the world depends on it! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/564f53c3fedf853e7c7dc74d0d2f7f02.poster.avif?t=1781142103\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/564f53c3fedf853e7c7dc74d0d2f7f02.webm?t=1781142103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your cult’s compound from the ground up. Design buildings and defenses, manage resources, put followers to work, and customize your home base! Every great cult starts with a great compound. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/366c585f497e5f7fe4931bc52ea40522.poster.avif?t=1781142103\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/366c585f497e5f7fe4931bc52ea40522.webm?t=1781142103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft a unique belief system so that your followers can make it the centerpiece of their lives!<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are you into? UFOs? Cannibalism? Intermittent fasting? All of the above? Maybe you just wanna hang around the drum circle and hammer out a sweet beat. The choice is yours, but choose wisely – once you convince your followers of a belief you’ll need to live with the consequences. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/818a09654de8606615ccf8c2e7c6f3f6.poster.avif?t=1781142103\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/818a09654de8606615ccf8c2e7c6f3f6.webm?t=1781142103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For some reason people don’t like it when you impose your radical lifestyle on them. Locals, police, and the government will try to put a stop to your fun. Fight back with a wide variety of weapons from shotguns, to miniguns, to snake launchers (if you were wondering, this is a gun that shoots live snakes). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful!  JOIN US operates on a permadeath system – once a character dies, they stay dead forever (unless they become a ghost, but that’s a whole other thing that we don’t need to get into right now). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/a0e8129ea4d65bae95e411cdf5977bb2.poster.avif?t=1781142103\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/a0e8129ea4d65bae95e411cdf5977bb2.webm?t=1781142103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We know this is kind of heavy - and we didn’t want to be the ones to break it to you. But the Apocalypse <i>IS</i> coming.  Planet Earth is going to be reborn. Your best chance to survive is to…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JOIN US.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got it?  Good.  Now go forth and do cult stuff. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh and please Wishlist.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/f457566f014493a6fc90e1c6444a7656.avif?t=1781142103\" width=1280 height=273 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HAVE YOU EVER DREAMED OF STARTING YOUR OWN CULT?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you can - right from the comfort of your own home! Imagine the respect you’ll receive as an up-and-coming cult leader! Issue weird teachings to your followers! Expand your territory! Build a base of operations! Perform sacrifices! Oversee a growing stockpile of military-grade weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this sandbox survival game, your most valuable resource isn’t stones and wood… it’s human beings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/c0215e7c34b2f607a93d5a27976a2682.poster.avif?t=1781142103\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/c0215e7c34b2f607a93d5a27976a2682.webm?t=1781142103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character in the world, from civilians to enemies, is a potential recruit for your growing cult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the game world into your personal follower-farm by spreading propaganda, managing infamy, and making your cult worthy of joining. Once a new follower joins your flock, you can put them to work, play as them, or enlist their support on missions. All of your followers have strengths and weaknesses, and are best used in accordance with their abilities – farmers, smooth-talkers, doctors, etc. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Followers are your most important resource, but also your most volatile. If you don’t keep them happy, they’ll quit the cult. And remember… a cult leader without any followers is just a lonely weirdo.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/5c549a5d54b1883f45fbd976188d93e1.poster.avif?t=1781142103\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/5c549a5d54b1883f45fbd976188d93e1.webm?t=1781142103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It wouldn’t be a cult unless your friends could join. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JOIN US supports up to 4-player co-op. Work together to build the cult of your dreams and crush all those that try to oppose you. The end of the world depends on it! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/564f53c3fedf853e7c7dc74d0d2f7f02.poster.avif?t=1781142103\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/564f53c3fedf853e7c7dc74d0d2f7f02.webm?t=1781142103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your cult’s compound from the ground up. Design buildings and defenses, manage resources, put followers to work, and customize your home base! Every great cult starts with a great compound. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/366c585f497e5f7fe4931bc52ea40522.poster.avif?t=1781142103\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/366c585f497e5f7fe4931bc52ea40522.webm?t=1781142103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft a unique belief system so that your followers can make it the centerpiece of their lives!<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are you into? UFOs? Cannibalism? Intermittent fasting? All of the above? Maybe you just wanna hang around the drum circle and hammer out a sweet beat. The choice is yours, but choose wisely – once you convince your followers of a belief you’ll need to live with the consequences. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/818a09654de8606615ccf8c2e7c6f3f6.poster.avif?t=1781142103\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/818a09654de8606615ccf8c2e7c6f3f6.webm?t=1781142103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For some reason people don’t like it when you impose your radical lifestyle on them. Locals, police, and the government will try to put a stop to your fun. Fight back with a wide variety of weapons from shotguns, to miniguns, to snake launchers (if you were wondering, this is a gun that shoots live snakes). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful!  JOIN US operates on a permadeath system – once a character dies, they stay dead forever (unless they become a ghost, but that’s a whole other thing that we don’t need to get into right now). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/a0e8129ea4d65bae95e411cdf5977bb2.poster.avif?t=1781142103\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/a0e8129ea4d65bae95e411cdf5977bb2.webm?t=1781142103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We know this is kind of heavy - and we didn’t want to be the ones to break it to you. But the Apocalypse <i>IS</i> coming.  Planet Earth is going to be reborn. Your best chance to survive is to…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JOIN US.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got it?  Good.  Now go forth and do cult stuff. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh and please Wishlist.</p>", "short_description": "Start a doomsday cult of your very own! Recruit followers, build your compound, customize your cult’s beliefs, and defeat enemies in this 1-4 player co-op, action-packed, open-world survival experience. Can you survive the Apocalypse?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian, German, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/8d6f3ab1edcf0145fce796c7e329f86edb4730af/header.jpg?t=1781142103", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/1b712b9a4b55cbaa991a1df02c8919102beb4485/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781142103", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/1b712b9a4b55cbaa991a1df02c8919102beb4485/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781142103", "website": "https://www.wolfhausgames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 2500X, Intel i5-8400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT, NVIDIA GeForce 1060<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Desire for true enlightenment</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600X, Intel i7-8700k<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 6700, NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Wolf Haus Games"], "publishers": ["Wolf Haus Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 48, "description": "LAN Co-op"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 56, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 58, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/b0b0aac22eed0492c39ca9bc492ea94df4403709/ss_b0b0aac22eed0492c39ca9bc492ea94df4403709.600x338.jpg?t=1781142103", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/b0b0aac22eed0492c39ca9bc492ea94df4403709/ss_b0b0aac22eed0492c39ca9bc492ea94df4403709.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781142103"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/7cdcadb9a1cd1fb753d380762a3ff6485b74e1ce/ss_7cdcadb9a1cd1fb753d380762a3ff6485b74e1ce.600x338.jpg?t=1781142103", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/7cdcadb9a1cd1fb753d380762a3ff6485b74e1ce/ss_7cdcadb9a1cd1fb753d380762a3ff6485b74e1ce.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781142103"}, {"id": 2, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a